# Source video portfolio — 1.2 GB, and one file exceeds GitHub's 100 MB
# per-file limit, so it cannot be committed. Poster frames in
# "public/Video Posters" are tracked; the videos need compressing and/or
# hosting on a CDN before the deployed site can play them.
/public/Video Portfolio
